A '''Mega Bat''' is a creature that spawns on any island during a [[Spooky Festival]]. It is the same as other [[Spooky Mobs]], and the [[Mayor Jerry]] mobs, where it only takes 1 damage per hit, and drops items on hit instead of on death. This property is quite similar to the [[Powder Ghast]]. It drops [[Candy (disambiguation)|candy]], and has {{Hp|100}} ([[Runecrafting#Runic Mobs|Runic]] Mega Bats have {{Hp|400}}). Mega Bats can be located with an [[Echolocator]].

== Spawning ==
The Mega Bat can spawn almost anywhere in the map. This can lead to some interesting spawn places like in the [[mountain]] or next to the void.

